OL,3,GNEWSAFabric nightclub plans gigs at St
OL,4,APaul's Cathedral
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Paul's Cathedral has signed a
OL,7,Ffour-year deal with the London
OL,8,Fnightclub Fabric to stage music events
OL,9,Finside the building.
OL,11,FUnder the partnership, Fabric will be
OL,12,Fthe cathedral's exclusive partner for
OL,13,Fsuch events until 2030. The first
OL,14,Fconcert is due to take place on 29
OL,15,FOctober, although the artist has not
OL,16,Fbeen announced.
OL,18,FFabric co-founder Cameron Leslie called
OL,19,Fthe deal "an extraordinary and
OL,20,Funexpected coming together of two very
OL,21,Fdifferent parts of London".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
