OL,3,GNEWSAFabric nightclub plans gigs at St
OL,4,APaul's Cathedral
OL,5,
OL,6,FSandra Lynes Timbrell, the cathedral's
OL,7,Fdirector of visitor engagement, said
OL,8,Fshe hoped a "carefully curated
OL,9,Fprogramme of exceptional concerts"
OL,10,Fwould draw people who had not visited
OL,11,Fbefore.
